ren NEWS -- history of user-visible changes.

* Noteworthy changes in release 1.0

** Now built with autoconf and automake, and licensed under GPLv3+.
** Messages are translatable through gettext.
** Source converted to ANSI C.
** Fixed a heap overrun when breaking rename cycles, a crash on end of
   input at the overwrite prompt, and an off-by-one in the replacement
   name length check.
** The search pattern may now contain any number of wildcards.  It used
   to be limited to 20, and exactly 20 overflowed a buffer by one entry.
** The replacement pattern can refer to any wildcard with #{n}, as in
   #{12}.  #1 through #9 work as before; #12 is still wildcard 1
   followed by the character 2.
** With -v, the " (*)" marker for an overwritten file now goes to
   standard output with the rest of the line instead of to standard error.
** Fixed the typo "substring numer" in an error message.
